---

Portions of this crate are derived from rtk (Rust Token Killer),
https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk, Copyright (c) Patrick Szymkowiak, MIT licensed.

Specifically, the following parts are adapted from it:
- src/ansi.rs        — strip_ansi and truncate, from rtk/src/core/utils.rs
- src/rules.rs,
  src/log.rs         — the rule pipeline stages (replace, match_output,
                       strip/keep_lines_matching, truncate_lines_at,
                       head/tail_lines, max_lines, on_empty), from
                       rtk/src/core/toml_filter.rs. Command matching, rule
                       layering, diagnostics, error-block detection and the
                       budget are new.
- src/rules/*.toml   — the first git, cargo, npm, pnpm, pytest and docker
                       rules started from rtk/src/filters/*.toml; they have
                       since been rewritten for the new schema.

